DESCRIPTION:Blank Check w/ Griffin & David is a podcast about filmographies
 
\; specifically those of Hollywood directors who achieved great success ear
 
ly on & thus were given a series of "blank checks" to make whatever crazy p
 
assion projects they wanted. As hosts Griffin Newman & David Sims say every
 
 episode: sometimes those checks clear & sometimes they bounce! Join Blank 
 
Check for a special live episode taping\, coinciding w/ their current mini-
 
series covering the work of Martin Scorsese. Door Time: 6:30pm (front bar o
 
pens 5:30pm). Show Time: 7:30pm. 21 & over w/ valid\, government-issued pho
 
to ID. General Admission standing & seating. Seating 1st come 1st served & 
 
not guaranteed. Arrive early for best selection. *Please email thebellhouse
 
@livenation.com prior to show w/ any accessibility requests. No outside foo
 
d/drink. $.25 per each ticket sold for a majority of events @ The Bell Hous
 
e benefits Comedy Gives Back\, a safety net for the comedy community. IG: @
 
comedygivesback. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/blank-check-l
 
ive-brooklyn-new-york-10-16-2026/event/300064F443246630
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/blank-check-live-brooklyn-new-york-10-16-2
 
026/event/300064F443246630
END:VEVENT
